Subject: [PATCH] mt7615: include the header declaring mac_pton

debugfs uses mac_pton(), declared by linux/hex.h on all supported kernels.
Include it explicitly rather than relying on transitive includes.

--- a/mt7615/debugfs.c
+++ b/mt7615/debugfs.c
@@ -1,3 +1,4 @@
 // SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-3-Clause-Clear
 
+#include <linux/hex.h>
 #include "mt7615.h"
